OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 gun site faces demolition in
OL,4,Aseafront plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two gun emplacement could
OL,7,Fbe demolished as part of a #6.9m scheme
OL,8,Fto stabilise a crumbling seafront.
OL,10,FSwanage Town Council wants to protect
OL,11,FSandpit Field and Weather Station
OL,12,FField, where ground movement has caused
OL,13,Fsignificant cracks in retaining walls.
OL,15,FDorset Council planning officers have
OL,16,Frecommended the plans for approval
OL,17,Fahead of a meeting on Wednesday,
OL,18,Fdespite 60 objections, many of which
OL,19,Fraised concerns about the loss of the
OL,20,Fwartime structure.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
