OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 gun site faces demolition in
OL,4,Aseafront plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe town council said continuing ground
OL,7,Fmovement had damaged the emplacement,
OL,8,Fand a report in August recommended it
OL,9,Fbe fenced off because of the risk of
OL,10,Fcollapse.
